/* CodeCat — English (base language).

   Keys and their English text also live at every call site as the `value:`
   argument of L10n.t/L10n.f, so a build that never assembled these .lproj
   directories still shows English rather than raw keys. This file is what
   ru.lproj is translated against; keep the two in step. */

